      "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #64748b;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;color:#1e5aa8;margin-bottom:12px;\">Uses of Nanotechnology</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;\">Transport</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Nanotechnology could allow the development of stronger <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Planes would be much lighter in weight.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> travel will be made available to the masses.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">Technology</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Computers will be even smaller, faster, and will have a greater <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> energy will become more affordable.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">The Environment</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Nano-robots could rebuild the ozone layer.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Pollutants such as <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> could be removed from water more easily.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; There will be no <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> from manufacturing.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">Health and Medicine</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; New methods of food production could eradicate famine.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Analysis of medical <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> will be speeded up.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Life expectancy could be increased.</p></div></div></div>",
